"content_DMXGyq":{"type":"content","settings":{"header_title_before_iconSvg":"","heading":"1. What is a height-adjustable standing desk？","content":"<p>A height-adjustable standing desk lets you seamlessly switch between sitting and standing while you work. Adjusting the desk to your preferred height helps improve posture, ease back strain, and support your overall well-being throughout the day.<\/p>","page":"","show_header_title_before_icon":false}},"content_Y3rTGF":{"type":"content","settings":{"header_title_before_iconSvg":"","heading":"2. How do I choose a standing desk for my home?","content":"<p>When choosing a standing desk for home use, consider your space, budget, and daily needs. Look for a desk with smooth height adjustment (electric desks are easiest), enough surface area for your monitors and accessories, good stability, and features like memory positions or cable management to keep your workspace organized.<\/p>","page":"","show_header_title_before_icon":false}},"content_pLMx3V":{"type":"content","settings":{"header_title_before_iconSvg":"","heading":"3. What’s the difference between electric standing desks and manual standing desks?","content":"<p>The main difference lies in how you adjust the desk height: Electric standing desk uses a motor to raise or lower the desk at the push of a button, offering smooth, effortless, and precise adjustments. Manual standing desk requires manual effort, such as turning a crank or using a lever, to change the desk height. It’s usually more affordable but less convenient for frequent adjustments.<\/p>","page":"","show_header_title_before_icon":false}},"content_XUbhgF":{"type":"content","settings":{"header_title_before_iconSvg":"","heading":"4. Which Blacklyte standing desk should I choose?","content":"<p>Blacklyte offers two electric height-adjustable standing desks: The <a href=\"\/products\/blacklyte-atlas-gaming-desk\" title=\"Atlas Desk\">Atlas<\/a> is designed for gamers and content creators, featuring RGB lighting effects for an immersive, high-performance setup. The <a href=\"\/products\/blacklyte-atlas-lite-desk\" title=\"Atlas Lite Standing Desk\">Atlas Lite<\/a> is ideal for work and home use, with dual motors, memory positions, and built-in cable management for a smooth and organized workspace.<\/p>","page":"","show_header_title_before_icon":false}},"content_KbpPrN":{"type":"content","settings":{"header_title_before_iconSvg":"","heading":"5. Do Blacklyte standing desks come with a warranty?","content":"<p>Yes, all Blacklyte standing desks come with a 3-year warranty. For added protection, you can join our <a href=\"\/pages\/warranty-extension\" title=\"Warranty Extension\">Extended Warranty Program<\/a> to extend coverage by 2 more years and receive a €10 cashback.<\/p>","page":"","show_header_title_before_icon":false}},"content_eJt3gC":{"type":"content","settings":{"header_title_before_iconSvg":"","heading":"6. Can I return or exchange my standing desk?","content":"<p>Absolutely. You can return or exchange your Blacklyte standing desk within 30 days of purchase, following our simple return process.<\/p>","page":"","show_header_title_before_icon":false}}},"block_order":["content_DMXGyq","content_Y3rTGF","content_pLMx3V","content_XUbhgF","content_KbpPrN","content_eJt3gC"],"custom_css":[".faqs-item {border-top: 1px solid #d3d3d3; font-family: Poppins;}",".collapsible-grid__item {border-bottom: 1px solid #e6e6e6;}",".collapsible-content {width: 100%; padding: 0 15.625vw;}",".halo-block-header {padding: 0 15.625vw; text-align: center;}",".halo-block-header h3 {font-family: Poppins; font-weight: 700;}",".card-body {color: #646669; font-size: 14px;}","@media screen and (max-width: 768px) {.collapsible-content {padding: 0 5.33vw; } .halo-block-header {padding: 0 5.33vw; } .card-body {font-weight: 400; }}"],"settings":{"id_section":"faq","container":"fullwidth","padding_full_width":50,"mg_top_desktop":100,"mg_top_tablet":50,"mg_top_mobile":40,"mg_bottom_desktop":100,"mg_bott